            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><b>A clear way back</b> from the color picker: <b>‹ Back</b> on the color strip at the top, or click the strip. When you&#x27;ve changed the color, <b>Use This Color</b> sits right there too.</li><li><b>Contrast on your own background.</b> Under Readable as text?, a third check tests your color on a background you choose: pick it from the screen, choose it from a palette, or right-click a History swatch. Same verdict, ratio and Fix as the white and black checks, and the panel remembers it.</li></ul>]]></description>
